ions 14(3), 15(1) and 21(3); (e) list the positions and corporations, trade or professional associations and trade unions disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(e); and (f) list any trusts disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(b.1). Sébastien Lemire · Member of Parliament OCIEC Translation Declaration type Disclosure Summaries (Code) Disclosure date January 20, 2026 Regime Conflict of Interest Code for Members of the House of Commons Description LiabilitiesTwo mortgages, joint with common-law partner, with DesjardinsHome equity line of credit, joint with common-law partner, with DesjardinsCar loan with DesjardinsSpouse's/Common-Law Partner's source(s) of incomeLast and Next 12 months:Employment income with Carrefour Rouyn-Noranda Disclosed on January 20, 2026","url":"https://www.ethicscanada.ca/en/public-registry/Details?declarationId=e2e9c331-ff3f-417f-a551-3b576efc68be"}],"other":[]},"lobbying":{"total":340,"first":"2020-02-04","last":"2026-10-07","byYear":{"2020":39,"2021":33,"2022":65,"2023":76,"2024":45,"2025":35,"2026":47},"topSubjects":[["Industry",47],["Agriculture",35],["Economic Development",32],["International Trade",29],["Environment",27],["Science and Technology",26],["Telecommunications",26],["Taxation and Finance",23]],"topOrgs":[["National Aboriginal Capital Corporations Association",13],["Canadian Federation of Independent Business (CFIB)",9],["Canadian Web3 Council",7],["AddEnergie",6],["Bell Canada",6],["Unifor",5],["Dairy Processors Association of Canada",5],["Xplornet Communications inc.",4]]}}